WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.432
Contracts are long,

00:00:01.432 --> 00:00:03.796
and the costly parts are easy to miss.

00:00:03.796 --> 00:00:05.476
Brief helps you catch them.

00:00:06.026 --> 00:00:08.805
Upload a lease, loan or job offer.

00:00:08.805 --> 00:00:10.685
A PDF, or just a photo.

00:00:11.235 --> 00:00:14.792
Brief reads every clause and pulls out the key terms:

00:00:14.792 --> 00:00:17.007
money, dates, and how to get out.

00:00:17.557 --> 00:00:18.476
Ask anything.

00:00:18.476 --> 00:00:21.019
Every answer cites the exact clause.

00:00:21.569 --> 00:00:23.654
And if the document doesn't say,

00:00:23.654 --> 00:00:24.892
Brief tells you so.

00:00:25.442 --> 00:00:27.794
It lists what to ask before you sign,

00:00:27.794 --> 00:00:29.637
and drafts the email for you.

00:00:30.187 --> 00:00:31.920
Your documents stay private.

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:33.158
Sign in with Google,

00:00:33.158 --> 00:00:34.768
add two step verification,

00:00:34.768 --> 00:00:37.492
and share read only with people you approve.

00:00:38.042 --> 00:00:38.431
Brief.

00:00:38.431 --> 00:00:40.053
Know what you're signing.
